@{ Layout = "_HomeLayout"; ViewData["Title"] = "About us"; }
<section class="public-page-hero"><span class="section-kicker">A LITTLE MOVEMENT. A HEALTHIER EVERY DAY.</span><h1>Good habits.<br />Better together.</h1><p>HealthTrack brings your activity, nutrition and trainer support into one place, so you can focus on making progress at your own pace.</p></section>
<section class="about-story public-section"><div><span class="section-kicker">WHY HEALTHTRACK</span><h2>A clearer view of<br />your everyday health.</h2><p>A workout here. A meal there. A small change you want to remember. HealthTrack helps you keep those moments together and turn your own records into a useful picture of your routine.</p><p>Our focus is simple: practical tracking, personal guidance and a place to see how far you've come.</p><a class="orange-button" href="/Account/Register">Start your journey<img src="~/lib/admin-icons/arrow-up-right.svg" alt="" /></a></div><img class="about-image" src="~/img/auth-wellness.png" alt="Woman stretching beside a quiet lake" width="1024" height="1536" /></section>
<section class="public-section"><h2 class="public-section-title">Made for the way you move.</h2><div class="info-card-grid"><article class="info-card"><img src="~/lib/admin-icons/activity.svg" alt="" /><h3>Keep your routine in view</h3><p>Record workouts, meals and measurements. Review your activity and weight trends on a personal dashboard.</p></article><article class="info-card"><img src="~/lib/admin-icons/clipboard2-check.svg" alt="" /><h3>Follow a personal plan</h3><p>View workout and nutrition plans published by your assigned trainer, with scheduled activities and reminders.</p></article><article class="info-card"><img src="~/lib/admin-icons/people-fill.svg" alt="" /><h3>Stay connected</h3><p>Receive trainer feedback and arrange appointments. Keep guidance and your next steps together.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="public-callout"><div><span class="section-kicker">ONE STEP AT A TIME</span><h2>Your next chapter starts with you.</h2><p>HealthTrack is a fitness tracking and coordination application. It does not provide medical diagnosis or treatment.</p></div><a class="black-button" href="/Home/Contact">Get in touch<img src="~/lib/admin-icons/arrow-up-right.svg" alt="" /></a></section>
